{"sourceUrl":"https://sme.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0908/c31027a752606/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:25.100465+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sme.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0908/c31027a752606/page.htm","html":"<div><p><a href=\"https://sme.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0908/c31027a752606/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>一、申请条件</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>电子信息类、生医类、数学类、物理类、材料类、机械类等相关专业的</span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span><span><span>届优秀本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>有望取得所在学校推荐免试研究生资格；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>学业成绩优秀，专业成绩排名前</span></span><span><span><span><span>30%</span></span></span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>二、网上报名</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>网上报名：在线报名系统已开通。请登录中国科学技术大学研究生报考服务系统</span></span><span><span><span><span>https://xspt.ustc.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span><span><span>，进入“推免生预报名”选择“集成电路学院”进行在线报名并提交相关材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>招生专业：学院招收硕士研究生的相关专业如下：</span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><strong>招生专业（一级学科）</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>下设二级学科、领域方向</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span>0809</span></span></span></span><span><span>电子科学与技术</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>080902</span></span></span></span><span><span>电路与系统</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>080903</span></span></span></span><span><span>微电子与固体电子学</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span>1401</span></span></span></span><span><span>集成电路科学与工程</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>01</span></span></span></span><span><span>集成电路设计与微纳系统</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>02</span></span></span></span><span><span>集成电路器件、工艺与制造</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span>0854</span></span></span></span><span><span>电子信息（专业学位）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>01</span></span></span></span><span><span>集成电路设计与系统</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>02</span></span></span></span><span><span>集成电路器件与工艺</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><strong>注：报考我校一级学科或报考我校专业学位：请从上表招生专业列中选择</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>报名截至时间：</span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>13</span></span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span><span>18</span></span></span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>学院将按照学校规定组织线下面试，具体时间及详细流程将通过邮件通知，未入选者不另行通知。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>三、材料提交</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>有效身份证件正反面扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>报名登记表（系统生成后下载打印，本人手写签字后扫描上传）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>在读证明或学生证扫描件（在读证明须加盖学校教务部门或所在院系公章；学生证须包含个人信息页和学期注册页）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>成绩单及专业排名证明（前两年半成绩单须加盖学校教务部门公章；专业排名证明以所在学校推免依据为准，加盖教务部门或院系公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span>个人简历（控制在</span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span>页以内）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></span><span><span>外语水平证明扫描件（英语四六级、托福、雅思等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span></span><span><span>个人能力证明材料扫描件（科研获奖、论文、专利等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>8.</span></span></span></span><span><span>个人材料汇总（将以上材料按顺序汇总至一个</span></span><span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span><span><span>文件），命名为：姓名</span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span><span><span>本科学校，上传至报名系统。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 报名阶段无需邮寄纸质材料，申请人须保证材料真实有效，一经发现弄虚作假，立即取消录取资格。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>四、注意事宜</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>学生必须先通过邮件联系我院导师，以导师推荐的形式入围预推免面试名单（导师名单见：</span></span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://sme.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0709/c31027a746899/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2026</a></span></span></span></span><span><span><a href=\"https://sme.ustc.edu.cn/2026/0709/c31027a746899/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">年集成电路科学营招生导师简介</a>）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>通过预推免面试但未被导师列入候选人名单的同学，可以联系我院其他导师直至达成双选，不需要重新面试；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>学院审核导师推荐、且通过面试的拟录取候选人名单后，名单中的学生方具备拟录取资格；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>教育部平台开放后（预计</span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>21</span></span></span></span><span><span>日），学生应按照导师通知要求填写系统，学院按照导师最终上报的推荐录取名单上的排序依次进行录取；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span>已经全程参与集成电路学院</span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span>月份集成电路科学营，且面试拿到合格的考生，本次预推免免面试环节，可直接联系招生导师直至达成双选意向；面试成绩不合格的考生，不可报名本次预推免，后续也不会录取；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></span><span><span>未尽事宜，可在交流群中咨询。以上条款的解释权在集成电路学院推免招生工作组。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>五、咨询联系方式</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>咨询电话（工作日</span></span><span><span><span><span>9:00-11:30</span></span></span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span><span><span>14:00-17:30</span></span></span></span><span><span>）：</span></span><span><span><span><span>0551-63601613</span></span></span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>咨询</span></span><span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span></span><span><span>群：</span></span><span><span><span><span>1054330506</span></span></span></span><span><span>（集成电路学院预推免咨询群），验证方式：姓名</span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span><span><span>本科学校</span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span><span><span>意向导师，报名后可入群咨询交流。</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"9828eee1120fa13039307ba303a4ef8887fa65ee8e7135e36af29e99c08edad2","textLength":1261,"sourceSha256":"22f36935f5bbc039f9b652e4da5998a4dd243e7b59991f382f9d6ec8340c0d96","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-75c9e6ad1286dcdbfabd","title":"2026年中国科学技术大学集成电路学院预推免招生公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:25.100465+00:00"}
